(Jon Grantham) writes:

   When playing 3.1, I often get the message "You feel agile!" or "You feel
   wise!"  or whatever, and I am told that I must have been very observant
   or exercising or whatever.  Are there specific things I can do to
   trigger these messages (which are accompanied by improvement in my
   stats), or are these messages completely random?

Well... Here's a sort of summary of the whole business.

**SPOILERS**


A plus in front of a statistic abbreviation means exercising of that
statistic, a minus sign a "bad" exercising of it. Every 600 turns or so it
checks its tally of these exercising scores to see if you should improve,
stay the same or get worse.

There is no exercising of int or cha
There is no physical exercising while polymorphed

*Hunger check every 10 moves
if satiated:                    -dex
if not hungry:                  +con
if weak:                        -str
if faint(ing/ed):               -con

*Encumber check every 10 moves
moderate:                       +str
heavy:                          +str -dex
extreme:                        -dex -con

*General check every 5 moves
if clairvoyant                  +wis
if regenerating                 +str
if sick or vomiting             -con
if confused or halluc.          -wis
have wounded legs/fumb/stun     -dex


Exercising directly due to your actions or things that happen to you:

-str            hit, dragged down stairs by iron ball
+wis            detecting gold, food
+wis            magic mapping level
+wis            finding secret doors, hidden/invisible monsters, trap
+dex            good kick
-dex            bad kick (hurt leg)
+wis            kicked sink and found ring
-str            kicked wall (Ouch!  That hurts!), strained muscle
-str            exploding door
+str            you shattered door or kicked it open
+dex            caught boomerang, hit monster by throwing object
+str            threw heavy ball, boulder
+wis            engraved Elbereth
-str            being burnt
+wis            good things from fountain (knowledge, Excalibur, gems..)
-wis            bad things from fountain (cursed item, lost gold..)
-con            quaffed bad water
+wis            found ring in sink
+str            pushed heavy object (boulder)
-dex            bump into door
+dex            attempted to pick lock (succeeded or failed)
+str or +dex    tried to force lock, failed
-dex            broke weapon while forcing lock
+str or +dex    successfully forced lock
+str            pulled at door that resisted
-str            being crushed or choked
-wis            mind attack succeeded
-dex            you are frozen!
-dex -str       wounded legs
+dex            charmed/calmed something with music
-wis            woke things up with loud "music"
+wis            tried to open drawbridge with instrument
+wis            sacrificing on altar
+wis            read scroll
+/-wis          read true/false rumor
+wis            study spellbook
-str            hit by falling rock
+dex            hit monster
+wis            writing scroll/spellbook
+/-dex          you speed up/slow down
+wis            use scroll/spell/wand

(Some reasonably obvious things have been left out)

